Type memorials inherit `:mm/Memory` plus type-system-specific extensions:

- **`tier`** — `stable-core` / `expanding-periphery` (mandatory; warning-severity if missing)
- **`abstract?`** — true for non-instantiable types
- **`required-fields`** / **`recommended-fields`** — frontmatter contract
- **`extends`** — parent type rel-path
- **Captureability metadata** (when mid-conversation-captureable): `mid-conversation-captureable`, `inject-trigger`, `inject-class-name`, `inject-action`, `audit-class`

